# The c_fc fp8 GEMM at its launch's K = 768: 12 K iterations, 25,165,824
# fp8 tensor flops per CTA; times the launch's 768 CTAs that is 2·M·N·K,
# Nsight Compute's sm__ops_path_tensor_src_fp8.sum for this launch
# (PLAN.md, hardware cross-check). At K = 768 the branch around the K
# loop is decided, so the loop is always entered and the counts are
# exact. The path for a K too short for the loop, $L__BB0_1, runs on no
# thread; the record executes it 0 times. Two default-value movs nothing
# reads are unused. The K loop's prefetch block runs on its trips with
# `iv < 10`, 10 of 12, counted trip by trip: 1,280 executions per CTA.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/gluon/fp8_gemm_kernel.c_fc.sm_89.ptx --bind 10:K=768 | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry fp8_gemm_kernel( // block 128×1×1 | param_10 = 768 | shared memory 0 B/CTA + dynamic | per CTA: flops f32 16,512; tensor flops fp8 25,165,824; sfu flops f32 128; global load 197,632 B, store 32,768 B; shared load 458,752 B, store 262,144 B; param load 8,192 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	mov.u32 %r22, 0x0; // unused{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	mov.u32 %r23, 0x0; // unused{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_3:                              // =>This Inner Loop Header: Depth=1 // loop: trips 12 | global per CTA: requested 163,840 B, unique ? | warp * × lane * | exec 1,536/CTA{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	mul.hi.u32 	%r169, %r608, -1431655765; // [<block 4>] warp * × lane * | runs when iv[$L__BB0_3] < 10 (CTA-uniform, branch at line 895) | exec 1,280/CTA{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_1:                              // %.._crit_edge_crit_edge // no thread{{$}}
